<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "30"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Ah, welcome back. Are you all right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had already finished the parfait.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">At the bottom of the glass the red juice of the strawberries was left behind.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, there's something I want you to hear."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was glugging down cola from the drink bar, who knew which glass by now, without even using a straw.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I slept a little at </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s place earlier... and I had a strange dream then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">At that, the two of them started and looked at each other.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Whoa... <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, that sort of thing from you is scary. And of all the places, you had it in my house."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I don't believe in the occult or psychic powers, mind you. But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s famous intuition, that I do believe in!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> grinned from ear to ear.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Somehow I feel like it has something to do with today's incident... It might just be my imagination, but will you listen for a bit?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">When I said that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> opened her notepad.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">―I told the two of them what was in the dream.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> listened with a serious face, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> listened while taking notes.</STYLE><PG>
"That's eerie, or rather... for a coincidence it's a bit much...
{PAUSE ""}
And on top of that it's the intuition at this time of year, right? That really can't be laughed off..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm, hmm. It may be connected to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s famous intuition. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Suppose for now it was a dream of being attacked by the red person. In that case, going by </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s reading, the story doesn't quite make sense. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">There were things here and there that bothered me, so I'll ask some questions."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, was that person a man? A woman? Could you not tell from the moaning?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The voice seemed like a man's, I think. But I think a woman could make that voice too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What about the last scream?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahh, that one I think was probably a man. Probably."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Then for now, let's take it that the person was a man and go on from there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was staring her notes down and scratching her head with her pen.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"You said he was asking </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> for help, but was that really it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It was a moan, wasn't it? He didn't actually say 'help me' or anything, did he?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's true, but..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So he was not definitely asking for help. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">After that your ankle was grabbed, wasn't it? Just before that, what did </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"At that point I was looking at the blood falling from the tree, and when I looked down my eyes met his... I think."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Your eyes met, and then your leg was grabbed?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> were both looking steadily at me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Let me try to remember a little better.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s questions set against my memory, there really is something that catches.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's wrong... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">After our eyes met, I said in a small voice, 'I'll call for help'. Then I was grabbed."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see, I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was fluently adding more to her notes.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"And at the end, when you said 'stop', the man sat up and shouted right in front of you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">What did he shout?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That hideous scream is burned into my ears even now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't know... just, something like 'waaaaaah'."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see, I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> added still more to her notes, then put the pen down with a sigh.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It seemed the information she needed had been gathered.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, this is dream analysis, so please listen to it as half a lie."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"It seems that person was neither asking </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> for help nor trying to do you harm."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That was neither asking for help nor attacking?</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"He was trying to tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> something. The danger that is coming down on </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A chill went through me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A while ago I had only thought instinctively that it was danger, and now it had come to agree with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s logical analysis.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Why do you think that? <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s in danger from now on?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. First, he was not clearly asking for help, was he? But at the very least, he was trying to appeal about something."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"And then when </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> tried to call for help, he grabbed your leg with tremendous strength. Do you see what that means?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I see. So it means 'don't go'."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right. 'Don't go. I haven't told </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> yet about the danger coming down on you.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"But you can't state for sure that that means telling her about danger, can you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s reasoning, I know, is useless to interrupt.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> was strangely in a hurry.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, that is the mystery. At the end the man sat up and shouted. Probably it was not just a shout. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If he meant to do harm, he wouldn't have only shouted. Strangling, or hitting. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But, that person chose to shout."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> finally stopped cutting in as well.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"He was trying to appeal about something. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Look, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has the intuition that senses danger. If it came from that, then 'he tried to convey the danger'. That was that person's purpose. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Well, I am explaining a hypothesis with a hypothesis, so it isn't logically sound."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Then if we knew what he shouted..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, can't you remember? What that person shouted."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm, I really don't know..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, could it have something to do with today's incident...? The situation is a little similar, and that's what's bothering me..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">When I said that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> began writing something, as if hiding her notepad.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But she stopped her hand at once and made a motion like erasing what she had written.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "76" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">For a while, silence ran on...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台,人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "0" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Dooooooh!!!!"</STYLE><BR>
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島万歳.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n五島万歳\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n300\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n五島万歳\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Suddenly </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> threw both hands up and started shouting, with no regard for the eyes around us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's wrong, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That startled me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> grinned from ear to ear.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"There's no use thinking about this anymore! Come on, come on, there are three of us here, so let's talk about something fun!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Right, right, and with that, Operation complete!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">For a moment we were dumbfounded, but</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"O-oooh, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, well said! <STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE> say something good once in a while too!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> leaned into it too, smiling.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I always say good things! </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="2"> has such a mean mouuuth!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Come to think of it, earlier,
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> here, looking at the online news: scary, scary! <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> is coming home late today: scary, scary!
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE>That's what she was saying! And a high school student at that!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huuh! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is so cuuute!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"W-wait a second! Don't make fun of me!"</STYLE><PG>
"Hahahaha! Sorry, sorry!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="2">! You mustn't bully </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> so much! </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="2">, unlike you, she is very delicate!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What was that, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>! Are you saying I'm coarse?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh? Oh? Any way you look at it, you are coarseness walking around in clothes. You are a long way from graceful!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Come on, come on, that's just the sort of thing!</STYLE>
{QUAKE "人物3" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "0" "500" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">W-wait, don't tickle me...!</STYLE>
{QUAKE "人物3" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "0" "500" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">　Gyahahaha!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Watching the two of them go at it, I let out a small laugh.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If that dream was the unpleasant intuition peculiar to this season, I had a feeling it would come down on me myself in some form.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> were both taking my side and encouraging me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was certain that getting it out and talking it over like this had made me feel lighter.</STYLE><PG>
